#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0720 expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
#note "PLAN-dynamic-column-corpus-respelling S4 member-only scenario: ADSL carries ONE planned-treatment variable, TRTPG1, a member of the one-digit TRTPGy family (find_vars(\"ADSL.TRTPGy\")). TRTP equals it, so the rule is silenced by that leg alone; a find_vars literal that missed the family would fire here."
dataset ADLBC
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col TRTP type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | Drug X
---

dataset ADSL label="Subject-Level Analysis"
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col TRTPG1 type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | Drug X
---
